      "extracted_by": "tools/extract_mirdct_coefficients.py",
      "quantity": "CTDIw",
      "unit": "mGy per 100 mAs at pitch 1.0",
      "usage": "CTDIvol = nctdi_w_mgy_per_100mas * (mAs_rot / 100) / pitch. The annex tabulates CTDIw at pitch 1.0, where CTDIw and CTDIvol coincide; CTDIw is pitch-independent, so the pitch division is applied by the caller.",
      "collimation_note": "Collimation is tabulated directly, so no over-beaming correction is applied to these values -- the collimation dependence is measured.",
      "model_name_note": "Model names are verbatim from the annex, including the source spellings 'Aquiliion ONE' and 'Defintion Edge'."
    },
    "sample_source": "OpenREM test objects (GPL-3.0), openrem/remapp/tests/test_files/CT-*.dcm, and a PixelMed sample. The objects are third-party and are not redistributed here; this file holds only measurements read out of them.",
