    "eligibility_rules": [
      "the event records a CTDIvol (DCM 113830)",
      "the scanner model resolves in the open coefficient database, exactly or by an alias denoting the same machine",
      "the acquisition has table feed (helical), because the formula models one rotation's output spread along the feed",
      "tube potential, mean tube current, exposure time per rotation, pitch, total collimation and the CTDIw phantom code are all recorded"
    ]
